  "given_answer": "\\(35{}^\\circ\\)",
  "answer": "\\(35{}^\\circ\\)",
  "given_solution": "【分析】本题考查了旋转的性质，等边三角形性质，根据等边三角形的性质求解即可．\n【详解】解：\\(\\because\\)\\(\\vartriangle ABC\\)是等边三角形，\n\\(\\therefore\\)\\(\\angle BAC=60{}^\\circ\\)，\n\\(\\because\\)\\(\\angle CAD=25{}^\\circ\\)，\n\\(\\therefore\\)\\(\\angle BAD=\\angle BAC-\\angle CAD=60{}^\\circ -25{}^\\circ =35{}^\\circ\\)，\n故答案为：\\(35{}^\\circ\\)．",
